      "body": "<!-- greptile_summary -->\n\n<h2><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/api/retrigger?id=64455580\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/RetriggerDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"Retrigger\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a>Confidence Score: 5/5</h2>\n\nThe PR appears safe to merge, with the POI name restoration narrowly scoped and supported by ownership, preservation, and integrated expression tests.\n\n<details><summary><h3>Summary</h3></summary>\n\nThis PR restores the source-requested English-first POI name expression for the three generated Mapbox Light density bands while preserving their filters, zoom ranges, and native label settings.\n\n- Resolves generated rule IDs from the validated source POI owner, including a single clipped band.\n- Applies `coalesce(\"name_en\", \"name\")` only to matching native POI rules still using the simplified `\"name\"` expression.\n- Adds focused ownership, collision, idempotency, expression, density-threshold, and preservation tests.\n- Documents the bounded content correction and the remaining collision, typography, zoom, and output-fidelity gaps.\n</details>\n\n<details open><summary><h3>Diagram</h3></summary>\n\n```mermaid\n%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%\nflowchart LR\n  Source[Mapbox Light source style] --> Validate[Validate unique POI owner]\n  Validate --> Generate[Generate clipped density-band IDs]\n  Source --> Simplify[Simplify style for QGIS]\n  Simplify --> Convert[QGIS style conversion]\n  Generate --> Match[Match native POI rule IDs and source layer]\n  Convert --> Match\n  Match --> Guard{Native field is expression name?}\n  Guard -->|Yes| Restore[Set coalesce name_en, name]\n  Guard -->|No| Preserve[Preserve native override]\n  Restore --> Labeling[Install native labeling]\n  Preserve --> Labeling\n```\n</details>\n\n<sub>Reviews (1) \u00b7 Last reviewed commit: [\"docs: record POI content evidence and co...\"](https://github.com/ebelo/qfit/commit/4b617d61a69ca4eb445f5e7b54c666c78413ef04)</sub>",
